{"unit_id":"ZIye1208__dsh-settings-nav-manager#card-zh","repo":"ZIye1208/dsh-settings-nav-manager","commit":"d268402260c8aa9f92f25e107855bde5e5f751dc","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-settings-nav-manager 是面向 DSH 网页和桌面端的设置导航整理插件。它在设置页加入编辑入口，并在主界面提供设置导航页。用户可拖动分区调整顺序、切换显隐、建立抽屉分组，也可把常用分区固定到侧栏后直接打开对应设置。排序和偏好保存在 DSH 设置命名空间中，包含恢复默认与读写失败提示。适合希望整理大量设置分区并快速进入常用项的 DSH 用户；需要兼容范围内的 DSH 与 Node.js 20.18 以上环境。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1802","client.js:3200-3242"]}
{"unit_id":"ZIye1208__dsh-settings-nav-manager#card-en","repo":"ZIye1208/dsh-settings-nav-manager","commit":"d268402260c8aa9f92f25e107855bde5e5f751dc","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-settings-nav-manager organizes DSH settings navigation for web and desktop. Users can reorder, hide, group, and pin sections from an edit control and sidebar page. Preferences persist in DSH settings. Requires compatible DSH and Node.js 20.18+.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1802","client.js:3200-3242"]}
