{"unit_id":"ZIye1208__dsh-settings-nav-manager#feature-reorder","repo":"ZIye1208/dsh-settings-nav-manager","commit":"d268402260c8aa9f92f25e107855bde5e5f751dc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-settings-nav-manager 的功能「拖拽排序」：在设置编辑模式中拖动导航行即可调整分区顺序，松开后保存新布局；位移阈值用于区分拖动与普通点击。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:200-230"]}
{"unit_id":"ZIye1208__dsh-settings-nav-manager#feature-visibility","repo":"ZIye1208/dsh-settings-nav-manager","commit":"d268402260c8aa9f92f25e107855bde5e5f751dc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-settings-nav-manager 的功能「分区显隐」：在编辑模式切换分区显示状态，隐藏项仍可在编辑时恢复；隐藏当前分区时会切换到可见分区。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:230-260"]}
{"unit_id":"ZIye1208__dsh-settings-nav-manager#feature-groups","repo":"ZIye1208/dsh-settings-nav-manager","commit":"d268402260c8aa9f92f25e107855bde5e5f751dc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-settings-nav-manager 的功能「抽屉分组」：创建并命名抽屉，将设置分区拖入或移出并调整组内顺序，也可折叠或解散抽屉。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:230-280"]}
{"unit_id":"ZIye1208__dsh-settings-nav-manager#feature-pins","repo":"ZIye1208/dsh-settings-nav-manager","commit":"d268402260c8aa9f92f25e107855bde5e5f751dc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-settings-nav-manager 的功能「固定常用分区」：在设置导航页面或编辑行点星标，将分区固定在主界面侧栏；点击固定项可进入对应设置，最多固定五项。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1370-1406"]}
{"unit_id":"ZIye1208__dsh-settings-nav-manager#feature-persistence","repo":"ZIye1208/dsh-settings-nav-manager","commit":"d268402260c8aa9f92f25e107855bde5e5f751dc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-settings-nav-manager 的功能「保存导航布局」：分区顺序、显隐、分组和固定状态写入 DSH 设置命名空间；读取异常时暂停保存并重试，避免以未知状态覆盖已有设置。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1802-1818"]}
